  "label": "administrators",
  "description": "The term 'admins' refers to individuals who hold administrative roles, typically in online communities, forums, or organizations. These roles involve moderating content, enforcing rules, managing user access, and maintaining order. The meme humorously exaggerates the frustration or exasperation admins feel when dealing with unruly or unreasonable group members, using the crying baby as an analogy for their emotional state. This requires background knowledge of administrative responsibilities and the common challenges faced by moderators in online spaces.",
